===Etymology===
From {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*maiwiz}}, a byform of {{der|ang|gem-pro|*maiwaz}}. Cognate with West Frisian {{m|fy|meau}}, {{m|fy|miuw}}, Old Saxon {{m|osx|mēu}} (Middle Low German {{m|gml|meve}}, from which German {{m|de|Möwe}}), Dutch {{m|nl|meeuw}}, Old Norse {{m|non|már}}, {{m|non|mór}}.

